{"4180170":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"VÖLUND","steam_appid":4180170,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4180170\/extras\/a02007158e1de1ea8e29bab08faf3489.poster.avif?t=1774050431\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=1170 height=191 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VÖLUND<\/strong> is a blacksmithing inspired roguelike about forging <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">mythic weapons and surviving the trials of a captive smith.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Dear god please buy my game, daddy!<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4180170\/extras\/67636313e89d30373106a4a391e20ddd.poster.avif?t=1774050431\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=1170 height=191 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover and gather rare ores, refine them in your forge, and craft ever-stronger <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">items to endure the king’s brutal trials and earn enough coin to satisfy his demands. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’ll need every edge you can find to survive the final round and forge your escape.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Your purchase of this game will help in getting new windows for my house to keep my family warm during the harsh Canadian winters.<\/i><\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\